diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..f4d0b4c 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,41 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the current browser for web push notifications. The browser hands the app the subscription it got from the push service.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | Push service endpoint URL |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | P-256 ECDH public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | Authentication secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/...",
+    "p256dh_key": "BN4GvZtE7YH...",
+    "auth_key": "tBHItJI5svbpez7KI4CCXg=="
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success. You may only register subscriptions for yourself.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Removes the current browser's web push subscription.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | Push service endpoint URL to remove |
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
