+#### Web push notifications
+
+To send push notifications to browsers, generate a VAPID key pair and set:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`
+
+You can generate a key pair from the app:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails web_push:generate_vapid_keys
+```
+
+Without these keys, people can still use the in-app notification tray; they just will not receive OS-level notifications on their phone or desktop.
